<title>USA: U.S. equity options volume in Feb up 18 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>U.S. equity options volume in Feb up 18 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. equity options volume in February totalled 18,804,006 contracts, up 18 percent from 15,955,433 in February 1996, the Options Industry Council (OIC) said Thursday.</p>
<p>In January, volume hit a record 23,001,365 contracts.</p>
<p>Average daily volume in February was 989,685 contracts, up from 797,772 in February 1996, the industry group said.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>((E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
